 she wants to  borrow the comic and keep it for the  next 10 years when minson speaks up for  herself they threatened to kill her on  her way home things start to get out of  hand but just then comes hote to min's  son's aid his father is a businessman  whose influence makes even the bullies  fear him hote beats up the guy in their  group and sends them all away he also  gives min's son his number so she can  call him if they trouble her again after  school minson is going through hote's  social media fawning over his pictures  after finding out what happened today  even inor believes hote has feelings for  his friend as they chat about him his  name flashes on min's son's phone and  she rushes to meet him outside when  asked why he called hote confesses that  he likes her and wants to take her out  on a date minson doesn't believe him at  first unused to male attention but as  hote leans in for a kiss her dream  becomes a reality minson closes her eyes  waiting for the kiss but it never comes  instead hote takes a picture of her most  vulnerable self and then makes fun of  her like the psychopath he is it is then  revealed that he never liked her and was  only being nice for a prank the bullies  join him laughing at min's son for  thinking that she had a chance with  someone like hote he is not just a bad  person but also a sociopath oh damn i  was joking but it's actually part of the  script he rules over the school and uses  his father's influence to terrorize  people for fun he wants min's son to  take on the responsibility of his slave  she must come to him whenever he demands  and he can do whatever he pleases with  her min's son is still in shock but she  knows her life is going to turn into  hell from now on moreover it is revealed  that minji was also in on the bully's  plan because she was threatened the  scene cuts to a month later minson  turned her phone off and hasn't been out  of the house since the bullying incident  she sleeps all day drowning in  depression her only companion is her  imaginary friend and he too is tired of  seeing her like that one day he  introduces her to the concept of revenge  the poor girl never thought going  against the bullies was possible but  enorm motivates her enough to do  something about her life in the  following montage minson changes her  lifestyle completely she manages her  diet and exercises to lose weight not  just that but she wraps herself with  tape and suffocates for hours driven by  the will to take revenge apart from her  weight she focuses on changing her  attitude and gaining more confidence  through several courses exactly a year  later min's son is a changed person she  is thinner and the most confident she  has ever been but she cannot help but be  nervous since it is the time to finally  face her fears the first person she goes  for is yong jae the least important  member of the bully group she starts by  hitting him and pretending to have  mistaken him for someone else youngjae  instantly falls for her charisma now  that min's son is conventionally  attractive and physically abusive they  flirt for a while before exchanging  numbers yangjae is over the moon while  min sun is ready for the next part of  the plan later that day hote notices  yang jae looking at his phone frequently  he doesn't allow any of his close mates  to do things without notifying him first  they aren't even allowed to be in a  relationship without his permission but  they put up with his demands to stay on  his good side upon realizing that  something is off about youngjae hote  jokingly threatens to kill his  girlfriend if he has one in secret hote  is deeply deeply in the closet minji  still works as a slave for the group and  buys things for them this time she  forgets to bring cigarettes angering  momo the last member of the group is  mina the kindest one of the lot who  wants to forgive minji hote registers  that she always interrupts him when they  are bullying people and warns her to be  careful when he is not around yongjae  calls min's son and they meet again  min's son is shocked at how differently  he talks to her than he used to the  change in behavior angers her as she  remembers how miserable she was because  of him only a year ago youngjae tells  her that he likes her but she rejects  him saying that she is in need of 1  million won and cannot be distracted the  next day yongjae sells his phone and  gaming console to get the money for her  min's son is taken aback but the gesture  angers her even more she says that she  will return the money in 10 years  mimicking their words to her youngjae  still doesn't get the hint though and is  shocked when she throws the money at him  and walks away he quickly stops her  asking her the reason she is rejecting  him minson truthfully claims that she  despises all bullies and he is one of  the known bullies in the school in reply  youngjae says he will leave the group  and change if it means that she will  accept him in the following scene minji  is again troubled by the group youngjae  approaches them asking her to go away an  angered hote inquires what he is doing  and is surprised to find out he wants to  leave the group just when things get  heated min's son comes to yangjae and  makes up an excuse to save him hote is  instantly alarmed by her presence but  thinks she is stunning to spite yong-jae  he is extra friendly to min's son and  even asks her for her number momo is not  happy about the interaction because she  is in love with hotei and they have been  in a relationship for a month now when  hote asks min sun for her number  youngjae comes in between and drags her  away he doesn't like that she interfered  in his matter but minsun hugs him and  makes him forget about it she claims to  be 10 in love with him as a joke so he  would work harder to make her fall  completely in love at night enor asks  minson if she is doing okay the change  in her attitude has also turned her  somewhat hea