 to  hit him with a baseball bat but taking  him by surprise someone else knocks him  out before he does anything a week  passes with no sign of yongjae sai is  worried that her plan might have failed  after so much work she still has to go  out with hote and is terribly nervous  given their history momo finds out about  this on her and hote's two month dating  anniversary to apologize for forgetting  hotei gives her a golden lighter as a  gift still momo is not someone who lets  things slide that easily she gathers up  a few men and goes to teach psy a lesson  for hitting on her boyfriend the  interaction is cut short when sai tases  momo and strangely enough the guys do  nothing she leaves the bully with a  final warning asking her to never bother  her again similarly mina who is the kind  one in the group apologizes to psy on  her own silence her go because she was  never really mean to her anyway now the  only person left to deal with is  [ __ ] mcgee in the next scene we see  a fight between hote inor and sai they  snap each other causing everyone's death  suddenly the scene changes to a  psychiatric hospital inor is a doctor  treating psy for her multiple  personality disorder in a wild turn of  events it is revealed that hote and the  bullies never existed they were  personalities derived from psy herself  last year size disorder grew intense and  she turned into a violent persona  brought out as hote unable to suppress  the persona she killed her sister min's  son eventually she realized what she did  and was struck by guilt to avoid taking  responsibility she made up the entire  story about min's son getting bullied so  that she would be a hero in her own  story not a murderer who killed her own  sister all this time she thought inor  was her imaginary friend because he  would interrupt her dream world but in  reality he was her doctor in real life  he reveals that he has been able to get  rid of all of psy's personalities except  for hotei if she doesn't get him out of  her head she will be locked away for  life a few days after psy is informed of  this hote's personality disappears  completely enor thinks his treatment  worked and sai is given little jail time  considering her sickness in the last  scene psy is out of jail talking to inor  about life she shows him a lighter  similar to the one hote gave momo when  they last met hinore looks at it in  shock realizing that the killer in psy  is still present somewhere inside her  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

